{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CJZdguuygwVTmmiVhiYJAc","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→id: test-rel00.0\n     2→title: \"Test Suite: rel00.0 — build lifecycle, cmd/version, pkg/format, pkg/sys, and pkg/testutils\"\n     3→release: rel00.0\n     4→\n     5→traces:\n     6→  - rel00.0-uc001-magefiles\n     7→  - prd011-magefiles R1\n     8→  - prd011-magefiles R2\n     9→  - prd011-magefiles R3\n    10→  - prd011-magefiles R4\n    11→  - rel00.0-uc002-format\n    12→  - prd003-format R1\n    13→  - prd003-format R2\n    14→  - prd003-format R3\n    15→  - rel00.0-uc003-sys\n    16→  - prd002-sys R1\n    17→  - prd002-sys R2\n    18→  - prd002-sys R3\n    19→  - prd002-sys R4\n    20→  - rel00.0-uc004-testutils\n    21→  - prd001-testutils R1\n    22→  - prd001-testutils R2\n    23→  - prd001-testutils R3\n    24→  - prd001-testutils R4\n    25→  - prd001-testutils R5\n    26→\n    27→preconditions:\n    28→  - A git repository with at least one tag matching v[0-9]*.\n    29→  - golangci-lint is installed and on PATH.\n    30→  - mage is installed and on PATH.\n    31→  - configuration.yaml exists at the project root with project.binary_dir set to bin.\n    32→\n    33→test_cases:\n    34→  # --- uc001-magefiles: build lifecycle and version ---\n    35→\n    36→  - name: build_produces_version_binary\n    37→    description: mage build compiles cmd/version to bin/version.\n    38→    inputs:\n    39→      command: \"mage build\"\n    40→    expected:\n    41→      exit_code: 0\n    42→      postcondition: bin/version exists and is executable\n    43→    traces:\n    44→      - prd011-magefiles R2.1\n    45→      - prd011-magefiles R2.4\n    46→\n    47→  - name: version_prints_tag\n    48→    description: bin/version prints the latest version tag and exits 0.\n    49→    inputs:\n    50→      command: \"bin/version\"\n    51→    expected:\n    52→      exit_code: 0\n    53→      stdout_pattern: \"v[0-9]+\\\\.[0-9]+\\\\